# 상태 줄 사용량이 좁은 폭에서 `Usage` 단추 하나로 접힌다(덩어리 29). 넓으면 Claude·Codex 묶음이 펼쳐진다.
waittabs 1 @30000
waitstate cwd=C: @30000
waitstate codex=Default:5h=40 @30000
send claude.exe -n 600 127.0.0.1\r
waitstate program=claude @20000
waitstate claude=Default:5h=23,week=61 @15000
resize 1400 700
waitstate usage mode=full button=no @5000
shot 01-wide
state wide
resize 600 700
waitstate usage mode=compact button=yes @5000
shot 02-compact
state compact
resize 1400 700
waitstate usage mode=full button=no @5000
quit
